{"4222280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Call", "steam_appid": 4222280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2>Welcome to <strong>The Last Call</strong>, a gritty FMV + FPS crime thriller that blends live-action storytelling with hard-hitting first-person shootouts.<br><br>In the rain-soaked underworld of 1980s Seattle, ex-DEA agent **Mack Callahan** is running on rage, guilt, and one last shot at justice. The cartel took everything from him. The system abandoned him. Now both are coming for blood.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A PLAYABLE VHS CRIME THRILLER</strong></h2>Experience a hybrid of <strong>FMV storytelling</strong> and <strong>first-person shooter gameplay</strong> built to feel like a lost 1980s revenge film.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/8945b416589432adb288357913b230e7.poster.avif?t=1774381887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/8945b416589432adb288357913b230e7.webm?t=1774381887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/8945b416589432adb288357913b230e7.mp4?t=1774381887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE IT RIGHT OR DIE</strong></h2>Haunted by the brutal murder of the woman he loved and betrayed by the very system he once served, Mack is now a wanted man - hunted by BOTH the cartel that destroyed his life, AND the agency that turned its back on him.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/30c2b4f47a31c632e0607a5790b71479.poster.avif?t=1774381887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/30c2b4f47a31c632e0607a5790b71479.webm?t=1774381887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/30c2b4f47a31c632e0607a5790b71479.mp4?t=1774381887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SERVE YOUR OWN JUSTICE</strong></h2>Mack wages a one-man war through drug pusher safehouses, back alleys, and nightclubs, determined to deliver his own brand of justice… no matter the cost.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/02d8565735c8d63bc632d6d0efc7ca9c.poster.avif?t=1774381887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/02d8565735c8d63bc632d6d0efc7ca9c.webm?t=1774381887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/02d8565735c8d63bc632d6d0efc7ca9c.mp4?t=1774381887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FPS + FMV HYBRID</strong></h2>The Last Call is a gritty, story-driven FPS/FMV hybrid that fuses intense, tactical first-person gunplay with cinematic live-action sequences. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/29568abb8c3b706d641a1f79412bcb3e.poster.avif?t=1774381887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/29568abb8c3b706d641a1f79412bcb3e.webm?t=1774381887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/29568abb8c3b706d641a1f79412bcb3e.mp4?t=1774381887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE TIME IS NOW!</strong></h2>Face off against ruthless cartel enforcers and crooked cops in relentless, close-quarters shootouts. Discover clues and unravel a twisting conspiracy soaked in betrayal, cocaine, and revenge.<br><br>This is Mack’s last ride through hell-and he’s taking everyone down with him.<br><strong>One bullet. One truth. One final call for justice.</strong><br>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2>Welcome to <strong>The Last Call</strong>, a gritty FMV + FPS crime thriller that blends live-action storytelling with hard-hitting first-person shootouts.<br><br>In the rain-soaked underworld of 1980s Seattle, ex-DEA agent **Mack Callahan** is running on rage, guilt, and one last shot at justice. The cartel took everything from him. The system abandoned him. Now both are coming for blood.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A PLAYABLE VHS CRIME THRILLER</strong></h2>Experience a hybrid of <strong>FMV storytelling</strong> and <strong>first-person shooter gameplay</strong> built to feel like a lost 1980s revenge film.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/8945b416589432adb288357913b230e7.poster.avif?t=1774381887\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/8945b416589432adb288357913b230e7.webm?t=1774381887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222280/extras/8945b416589432adb288357913b230e7.mp4?t=1774381887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE IT RIGHT OR DIE</strong></h2>Haunted by the brutal murder of the woman he loved and betrayed by the very system he once served, Mack is now a wanted man - hunted by BOTH the cartel that destr